        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Mathis Coater: Equipment-specific dashboard\n\nThis dashboard plots semantic properties that are unique to the Mathis coating equipment wrapper and are not available in the FOM equipment wrapper.\nThe displayed signals represent Mathis-specific functionality, including IR pyrometer temperature measurements used to monitor web temperature within the dryer and fan control setpoints used to configure dryer operating conditions. These properties are specific to the current equipment configuration and may not be available on other coating systems.\n\n\nThis dashboard plots **5 channel(s)** grouped under **2 semantic property/properties**.\n\nEach time-series panel represents one semantic property. Signals that use the same semantic property and physical unit are displayed together so that related equipment values can be compared.\n\nThe data is read from the equipment time-series tables. Each table contains a `time` column and a `value` column.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
