      "description": "Plots channels associated with `coater:hasFurnaceFanControl`. Channels: Dryer1_Bottom_Fan_SP, Dryer1_Top_Fan_SP, Dryer2_Bottom_Fan_SP, Dryer2_Top_Fan_SP. Category: control. Unit: https://w3id.org/emmo#RevolutionPerMinute.",
